 3. Training data 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Anthropic may have doubled the pace at which it is developing AI models, according to new research from METR, a research organization that's part of an experiment in "embedded" evaluations. Dario Amodei gets the New York Times treatment , which looked into how his "thinking on artificial intelligence was shaped." 
 
